    "name": "NUIX ECC REST API Command Reference Case Log API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Welcome to the Nuix ECC REST API command reference. From here you can access all available ECC REST APIs.  You can also send REST commands to your running ECC Server, as well as view the responses.\n\n**Note\\:** The Nuix ECC User Guide includes a gloassary which defines specialized terms such as `Case`, `Custodian` and `Target` which are mentioned throughout this command reference.\n\n**Note\\:** This command reference has been updated for Nuix ECC version 9.12.0.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Nuix\n Email: APISupport@nuix.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
